      "notes": "OTR Jakarta Rp1,502,000,000 (MINI price list). Conflicts on MINI's own site: battery 66.5 kWh (family table) vs 64.6 kWh (model page, likely net); range 500 km (table) vs 433 km (FAQ; Moladin also 433 km WLTP); power 313 hp vs 308 hp, both 230 kW; torque 494 Nm (Moladin table 492 Nm). AC: MINI 11 kW / 6.5 h; Moladin 22 kW / 6.25 h. Boot up to 1,390 l folded. Moladin lists 9 airbags but its own breakdown doesn't add up, so airbags left out. Connectors and frunk from the European spec (ev-database.org). ADAS from the Malaysian spec of the same 66.5 kWh, 313 hp AWD model (paultan.org). Battery check (Nov 2026): the 64.6 kWh on MINI Indonesia's model page is the usable capacity (matches the European spec), now stored as usable capacity; 66.5 kWh is gross.",
